WEBVTT

00:02:29.871 --> 00:02:32.213
we started striking from school.

00:02:33.578 --> 00:02:35.848
I know you've probably
seen it on the news,

00:02:35.872 --> 00:02:37.917
and maybe it's not that special anymore.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.622
But at the time,
it was a huge deal, Abuelita.

00:02:41.646 --> 00:02:45.999
Imagine kids not going to school,
because we want people to save the world.

00:02:46.023 --> 00:02:48.964
(Video) Crowd: Another world
is possible! We are unstoppable!

00:02:48.988 --> 00:02:51.380
Xiye Bastida: For the first
global climate strike,

00:02:51.404 --> 00:02:53.282
which was called on by Greta Thunberg,

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:56.958
I got 600 of my classmates
to walk out with me.

00:02:58.474 --> 00:03:01.889
Greta Thunberg is a teenager
who first started striking for climate.